THIRD-PARTY CONTENT

The figure collections bundled with this mod depict characters from works
owned by third parties: Adventure Time, Alien Stage, Deltarune, Dispatch,
Five Nights at Freddy's, JoJo's Bizarre Adventure, Jujutsu Kaisen, One Piece,
Star Wars, Stranger Things and Super Mario. The following reproduce those
characters, names or logos, are not covered by this license, and remain the
property of their respective owners:

  - the character textures in
    common/src/main/resources/assets/blockpops/textures/figure/, in each of
    its per-collection subdirectories;
  - the franchise logos in
    common/src/main/resources/assets/blockpops/textures/block/box/logo/,
    except logo_worldplayers.png;
  - the character and collection names in
    common/src/main/resources/data/blockpops/collections/.

The Modrinth, CurseForge and Discord icons in
common/src/main/resources/assets/blockpops/textures/gui/ are trademarks of
their respective owners and are likewise not covered by this license.

The figures of players generated at runtime use those players' own skins.


